'''Titan eSports''' is a now defunct professional gaming organisation, founded in September 2013. The organization was located in [[:Category:Singapore|Singapore]] and previously hosted a [[:Category:France|French]] ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' and a [[:Category:Europe|European]] Smite team before being released. They have previously hosted a [[:Category:Malaysia|Malaysian]] Dota 2 team from August 22, 2013 to October 10, 2014. The organization dissolved on January 13, 2016.

