|content4=
* January 13th - '''Titan''' ceases operations, citing financial constraints partially related to [[KQLY]]'s [[banned|ban]]. <ref name="Titan Bids Farewell">{{cite web|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160114010849/http://titan.pro/news/read/Titan-Bids-Farewell/58|date=2016-01-13|title=Titan Bids Farewell|author=Damien Grust|publisher='''Titan'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* July 20 - '''Titan''' and [[Team EnVyUs|EnVyUs]] swap players, [[shox]] and [[SmithZz]] join the team, while [[kennyS]] and [[apEX]] leave. <ref name="Titan, EnVyUs swap players">[https://www.hltv.org/news/15529-titan-envyus-swap-players Titan, EnVyUs swap players], [[HLTV]]</ref>
* September 23rd - '''Titan''' release [[Maniac]], and acquire [[ScreaM (Belgian player)|ScreaM]] from [[Gamers2]]. <ref name="Titan CS:GO Roster Changes">[http://titan.pro/news/read/Titan-CS-GO-Roster-Changes/47 Titan CS:GO Roster Changes], Titan CS:GO Roster Changes, ''Titan.pro''</ref>

|content2=
* January 1st - the former squad of [[VeryGames]] joins Titan. <ref name="Titan sign ex-VeryGames">[https://www.hltv.org/news/11911-titan-sign-ex-verygames Titan sign ex-VeryGames] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
* April 28th - [[shox]] leaves, and [[kennyS]] joins. <ref name="Titan Player Change - kennyS Returns">[http://titan.pro/news/read/Titan-Player-Change-kennyS-Returns/5 Titan Player Change - kennyS Returns] ''titan.pro''</ref>
* August 27th - First rumors of changes in the team surface; [[NBK]] and [[SmithZz]] are rumored to form a new team with [[shox]], [[kioShiMa]] and [[Happy]]. <ref name="NBK, ScreaM, SmithZz out - Report">[https://www.hltv.org/news/13126-nbk-scream-smithzz-out-report NBK, ScreaM, SmithZz out - Report] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
* September 3rd - [[NBK]] and [[SmithZz]] leave to create [[Mercenary]] with the rumored players, whereas [[ScreaM (Belgian player)|ScreaM]] starts [[BST]] with [[Sf]], [[GMX]], [[fxy0]] and [[Uzzziii]]. The ex-[[LDLC.com]] trio of [[apEX]], [[KQLY]] and [[Maniac]] joins to fill the gaps in Titan. <ref name="bst and mercenary">[https://www.hltv.org/news/13157-scream-in-new-team-for-faceit ScreaM in new team for FACEIT] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
* October 20th - [[ioReK]] joins Titan as an analyst. <ref name="iorek joins titan">[https://www.hltv.org/news/13438-iorek-joins-titan-as-analyst] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
* November 20th - [[KQLY]] receives a VAC-ban and is suspended, thereby disqualifying Titan from [[DreamHack Winter 2014]]. <ref>https://www.hltv.org/news/13636-kqly-handed-vac-ban</ref><ref>https://www.hltv.org/news/13638-titan-suspend-kqly-following-ban</ref><ref>[http://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198000020858 KQLY's Steam profile]</ref><ref>https://www.hltv.org/news/13642-titan-epsilon-disqualified-from-dhw</ref>
* November 21st - [[KQLY]] is removed from the team due to his VAC-ban on the 21st of November. <ref name="kqly removed from titan">[https://www.hltv.org/news/13650-kqly-removed-titan-criticize-valve kqly removed from titan] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
* December 23rd - [[RpK]] joins the team. <ref name="RpK comes back in Titan">[https://www.hltv.org/news/13879-rpk-comes-back-in-titan RpK comes back in Titan] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
|content1=
* August 22nd - '''Titan''' is created.
}}

